{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Match/DiteTree.html#Lean.Meta.Match.splitDiteTree\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Match</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitDiteTree</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Given a goal `tree = rhs` where `tree` is a tree of tests `dite (x = v) (Eq.ndrec_symm m) e`,\ntraverses the tree and closes the branches that are refuted by a hypothesis of the form\n`... → False`, or where both sides are definitionally equal. Returns the goals for the remaining\nbranches. Throws an exception if the goal is not of this form.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Match/DiteTree.html#Lean.Meta.Match.splitDiteTree","kind":"def","line":327,"name":"Lean.Meta.Match.splitDiteTree","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Match/DiteTree.lean#L327-L338"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Basic","Lean.Meta.Match.Value","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Contradiction","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Refl","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Replace","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Simp.Rewrite","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Subst","Lean.Util.ForEachExpr"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Match.DiteTree"}